#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.1.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: May 16, 2021"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:6
msgid "**4.1.2 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:15
msgid ""
"Fixed `a bug <https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/issues/4116>`_"
" in ``current_url()`` that prevented configurations with an ``indexPage``"
" from including that value in the return value. Any installations using "
"``App::$indexPage`` should expect altered values from ``current_url()`` "
"and all its dependencies (including Response Testing, Pager, Form Helper,"
" Pager, and View Parser)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:21
msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:23
msgid ""
"New HTTP classes, ``Cookie`` and ``CookieStore``, for abstracting web "
"cookies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:24
msgid "New ``assertRedirectTo()`` assertion available for HTTP tests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:25
msgid "New logger handler, ``ErrorlogHandler``, that writes to ``error_log()``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:26
msgid "Entity. Added custom type casting functionality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:27
msgid ""
"New option in routing. The ``priority`` option lower the priority of "
"specific route processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:28
msgid ""
"The ``Autoloader`` class can now load files which do not contain PHP "
"classes. The list of `non-class` files will be listed in the ``$files`` "
"property of ``Config\\Autoload`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:31
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:33
msgid "Layouts in views now support nested sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:34
msgid ""
"``Response::getCookie`` now returns a ``Cookie`` instance instead of an "
"array of cookie attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:35
msgid ""
"``Response::getCookies`` now returns an array of ``Cookie`` instances "
"instead of array of array of attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:36
msgid ""
"To eliminate warnings from modern browsers' consoles, empty samesite "
"values will be defaulted to ``Lax`` on cookie dispatch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:37
msgid ""
"`Model::errors()` and `BaseModel::errors()` now always returns `array`; "
"there was no definition change but the docblock has been updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:38
msgid ""
"``Entity::castAs`` has changed behavior. Added new parameter ``$method``."
" Type casting has been moved to separate handlers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:39
msgid ""
"Entity. Timestamp casting now throws an exception when an invalid value "
"is passed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:40
msgid "``Entity::castAsJson`` uses external cast handler ``JsonCast::get``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:41
msgid "``Entity::mutateDate`` uses external cast handler ``DatetimeCast::get``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:42
msgid ""
"In order for ``Config\\**`` classes to get their respective properties' "
"values from the ``.env``, it is now necessary to namespace the property "
"with the name of the class. Previously, the property names are enough but"
" now disallowed because it can get system environment variables, like "
"``PATH``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:43
msgid ""
"The array helper ``_array_search_dot`` is now marked for ``@internal`` "
"use. As this is used by ``dot_array_search``, users should not use "
"``_array_search_dot`` directly in their code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:44
msgid ""
"``CacheInterface::getMetaData()`` returns ``null`` for misses, or an "
"array with at least the \"expires\" key set to the absolute epoch "
"expiration, or ``null`` for \"never expires\". The File, Memcached, and "
"Wincache Handlers still return ``false`` which will become ``null`` in a "
"future release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:47
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:49
msgid "Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\View\\View::$currentSection`` property."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:50
msgid ""
"Language strings and exceptions on invalid cookie samesite are deprecated"
" for the ``CookieException``'s own exception message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:51
msgid "Deprecated `CodeIgniter\\Entity` in favor of `CodeIgniter\\Entity\\Entity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:52
msgid ""
"Deprecated cookie-related properties of ``Response`` in order to use the "
"``Cookie`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:53
msgid ""
"Deprecated cookie-related properties of ``Security`` in order to use the "
"``Cookie`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:54
msgid ""
"Deprecated cookie-related properties of ``Session`` in order to use the "
"``Cookie`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:55
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Security::isExpired()`` to use the ``Cookie``'s internal "
"expires status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:56
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CIDatabaseTestCase`` to use the ``DatabaseTestTrait`` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:57
msgid "Deprecated ``FeatureTestCase`` to use the ``FeatureTestTrait`` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:58
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``ControllerTester`` to use the ``ControllerTestTrait`` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:59
msgid ""
"Consolidated and deprecated ``ControllerResponse`` and "
"``FeatureResponse`` in favor of ``TestResponse``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:60
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Time::instance()``, use ``Time::createFromInstance()`` "
"instead (now accepts ``DateTimeInterface``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:61
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``IncomingRequest::removeRelativeDirectory()``, use "
"``URI::removeDotSegments()`` instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:62
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``\\API\\ResponseTrait::failValidationError()`` to use "
"``\\API\\ResponseTrait::failValidationErrors()`` instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:65
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:67
msgid ""
"``BaseConnection::query()`` now returns ``false`` for failed queries "
"(unless ``DBDebug==true``, in which case an exception will be thrown) and"
" returns boolean values for write-type queries as specified in the docs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.2.rst:69
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.1.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.1.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

